{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>善存三效益生菌配方60粒裝（Centrum Triple Action Probiotics）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧、Market Place及龍豐共4間零售商的網店報價。以同款單盒標價計，最低與次低相差HK$105，約27%。</p>\n<h2>善存三效益生菌配方60粒裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜龍豐</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$290</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$290</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單盒標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Market Place</td>\n<td>HK$395</td>\n<td>HK$395</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$395</td>\n<td>HK$395</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$395</td>\n<td>HK$395</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>善存三效益生菌配方60粒裝單盒價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一盒善存三效益生菌配方60粒裝，龍豐的同款網上標價為HK$290，較表列次低標價HK$395少HK$105。善存三效益生菌配方60粒裝這個價差以單盒商品標價比較。若打算買多件，宜另計商戶的購買條件及結帳價。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月28日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E5%96%84%E5%AD%98-%E5%96%84%E5%AD%98%E4%B8%89%E6%95%88%E7%9B%8A%E7%94%9F%E8%8F%8C%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B960%E7%B2%92%E8%A3%9D/p/BP_811551\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/centrum-triple-action-probiotics-60-tablets/p/069039\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.marketplacehk.com/zh-hant/wellcome/p/product/i/101575407.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Market Place</a><a href=\"https://eshop.lungfung.hk/product/mdn250027/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龍豐</a></p>\n<p>善存香港列出的成分包括益生菌、益生元及消化酶。益生元可作為部分腸道微生物的養分。益生菌的作用則視乎菌株及用途而異。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://www.nccih.nih.gov/health/probiotics-usefulness-and-safety\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NCCIH：益生菌資料</a></p>\n<p>本次以（HK$395－HK$290）÷HK$395×100%計，約27%。計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179583946199226142_3870061036b0a55e69d7c0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"善存三效益生菌配方60粒裝格價\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179583946199226142_3870061036b0a55e69d7c0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到善存三效益生菌配方60粒裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月28日網上報價，龍豐的單盒商品總額為HK$290。條件為單盒標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>本次比較善存三效益生菌配方60粒裝，善存其他益生菌系列和粒數各有不同。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T04:41:22.453540+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":794,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T04:17:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T05:17:23.072572+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T04:34:44.071480+00:00","content_hash":"06d8af64729e05fff872f48d20e08dac74ca61485ddb425e3471a02900d571ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}